//! Collation golden data generated from the TS oracle (D8, plan risk 1).
//!
//! Generated by running `src/switcher.ts` (commit `53de029`) on Bun 1.4.0
//! (`Intl.Collator().resolvedOptions()`: locale `en-US`, ICU 78.1, Unicode 17.0):
//!
//! ```text
//! LANG=en_US.UTF-8 bun crates/envswitch/tests/switcher_oracle/collation_golden.ts \
//!   . crates/envswitch/src/switcher/collation_golden.rs && cargo fmt
//! ```
//!
//! The generator builds `GROUPS` with `a.localeCompare(b)` (and checks that
//! the comparator is a consistent total preorder on the set), then runs the
//! oracle's `switchEnvironment` (not dry-run) with one `layer:shared` item per
//! title, `id` = `tNNN` in `TITLES` order, values `{COMMON: id}`, and checks
//! that the oracle's layer order equals the stable sort implied by `GROUPS`.
//! `FULL_ENV` is the oracle's `.env` bytes. `PAIRS` repeats that for two
//! items (ids `L` and `R`) in both API orders and records the `COMMON` winner.
//!
//! Han titles are limited to ones where ICU4C and ICU4X agree; the known
//! Han divergence is pinned separately in `tests.rs`.

/// Item titles in `op` API order; item `i` has id `t{i:03}`.
